  "-1456977725": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 378084120,
   "actor": "Tasha",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Well… that was brutal. But honestly? You all handled it like champs. Sometimes the dice just don’t care. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-206355080": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 378084120,
   "actor": "Tasha",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Total wipe. Oof. But hey, no one panicked, and the chaos was kinda beautiful. I’ve seen way worse. New characters, fresh start.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2009250990": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 378084120,
   "actor": "Tasha",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Okay, yeah, you all died. Spectacularly. But the story was fun, the energy was solid, and that’s what matters. Let’s rebuild and try again.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "598455007": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 378084120,
   "actor": "Tasha",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "That boss fight was never supposed to be easy. And still, you made it interesting right to the end. I’ll tweak a few things",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-383742310": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Tasha",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Rough ending, but you played it well. Tabletop games are not about winning.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  }
 },
